    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;MOtion Wulin&quot; \u2013 A Wuxia Action Game of Time-Traveling Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Worldview: Shattered Time, Interwoven Martial Realms]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Game Content</strong><br>This is a martial arts-themed action combat game where players assume the role of a warrior, challenging various enemies and enhancing their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Story Synopsis</strong><br><i>&quot;Rifts in time appear, warriors from all eras gather; a single strike decides fate, all realms merge into one path.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 2045, a quantum experiment accidentally tears the fabric of time, causing martial artists from different dynasties to converge in the modern world. As a special agent of the &quot;Time-Space Administration,&quot; you must travel across different eras, battle formidable foes, and restore the fractured timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Game Features</strong><br><strong>[Dynamic Martial Arts]</strong> \u2013 A fully free-form combat control system that puts complete weapon mastery in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.poster.avif?t=1754832823\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.webm?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.mp4?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enemy's blade strikes\u2014will you raise your sword to block, sidestep to evade, or deflect with a well-timed parry? The system calculates weapon collisions and force direction in real time. Success depends on your reflexes and skill, not random chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.poster.avif?t=1754832823\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.webm?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.mp4?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;MOtion Wulin&quot; \u2013 A Wuxia Action Game of Time-Traveling Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Worldview: Shattered Time, Interwoven Martial Realms]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Game Content</strong><br>This is a martial arts-themed action combat game where players assume the role of a warrior, challenging various enemies and enhancing their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Story Synopsis</strong><br><i>&quot;Rifts in time appear, warriors from all eras gather; a single strike decides fate, all realms merge into one path.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 2045, a quantum experiment accidentally tears the fabric of time, causing martial artists from different dynasties to converge in the modern world. As a special agent of the &quot;Time-Space Administration,&quot; you must travel across different eras, battle formidable foes, and restore the fractured timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Game Features</strong><br><strong>[Dynamic Martial Arts]</strong> \u2013 A fully free-form combat control system that puts complete weapon mastery in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.poster.avif?t=1754832823\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.webm?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.mp4?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enemy's blade strikes\u2014will you raise your sword to block, sidestep to evade, or deflect with a well-timed parry? The system calculates weapon collisions and force direction in real time. Success depends on your reflexes and skill, not random chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.poster.avif?t=1754832823\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.webm?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.mp4?t=1754832823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
